## Slide 7 — System Architecture / Workflow

**Major corrections needed:**

| # | Current (Wrong) | ✅ Correct Architecture |
|---|---|---|
| 1 | Android App (Kotlin) | **Flutter/Dart** mobile app with **Kotlin PermissionBridge** for UsageStats only |
| 2 | Firebase Realtime DB | **Supabase (PostgreSQL)** for session & event storage |
| 3 | BigQuery + Pub/Sub | NOT used — replace with **FastAPI REST API on Render** |
| 4 | Cloud ML Engine / Vertex AI | NOT used — replace with **Rule Engine (Python)** in backend |
| 5 | FCM Push Notification | ✅ Correct — FCM IS used |

**Correct Architecture Flow:**
```
Flutter App (Dart)
  → Kotlin PermissionBridge (UsageStats)
  → Focus Detection Engine (Dart state machine)
  → FastAPI Backend (Python / Render)
      → Rule Engine (scoring_service.py + rule_engine.py)
      → Supabase PostgreSQL (sessions, events, analytics)
  → FCM Push Notification (Firebase Messaging)
  → Supabase Realtime Sync
```

