**Correct Module 2 description:**
> Events from Flutter app are sent via `POST /api/v1/events` to the **FastAPI backend** (Python, hosted on Render). The backend validates schemas using **Pydantic v2**, stores events in **Supabase (PostgreSQL)** via SQLAlchemy, and triggers real-time score computation.

