## Slide 12 — Module 2: Technical Details / Algorithm (Pseudocode)

Replace entire pseudocode with:
```
1. Flutter app detects app switch via FocusDetectionEngine (Dart state machine)
2. FocusState transitions: focus → grace → transition → distraction → recovering
3. Distraction event serialized: {package_name, event_type, triggered_at, app_category, time_away_seconds}
4. HTTP POST /api/v1/events → FastAPI backend (Render)
5. Pydantic validates event schema
6. SQLAlchemy writes to Supabase PostgreSQL (distraction_events table)
7. Scoring triggered: POST /api/v1/scoring/session/{session_id}
8. RuleEngine.compute_risk() → risk label: SAFE / LOW / MEDIUM / HIGH / CRITICAL
9. Score returned to Flutter app for real-time UI update
```

