## Slide 18 — Module 4: Technical Details / Algorithm

Replace pseudocode:
```
1. FocusDetectionEngine (Dart) detects distraction onset
2. State machine transitions: focus → grace (10s) → transition (20s) → distraction
3. Distraction event POSTed to FastAPI /api/v1/events
4. RuleEngine computes risk_score → recommendation string
5. IF risk == HIGH or CRITICAL: trigger FCM notification
6. Firebase Cloud Messaging sends push via firebase_messaging SDK
7. flutter_local_notifications displays in-app alert
8. Recovery technique shown (Pomodoro / breathing / walk) based on risk level
9. User returns to focus app → state → recovering → focus
10. Session score updated in Supabase via /api/v1/scoring/session/{id}
```

